<title>UK: EIB sets 10 bln pesata March 2007 fungible bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 10 bln pesata March 2007 fungible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was</p>
<p>announced by joint lead managers BSN and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    *10 BLN PTA   COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    20.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  1.875     PAY DATE  **12.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    MADRID    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	*FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING 15 BLN PESATA BOND</p>
<p>	     **PLUS 52 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>DENOMS (K) 100 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
